	description: "Important machine",
	text: [
		"The Assembly Machine (a.k.a Assembler) is the most important machine in the Nuclear Tech Mod. All other important machines or items are made using the Assembly Machine.",
		"",
		"It requires electricity just as any other machine, to connect it to your grid take a look at the sides of the physical machine, you will see several ugly, gray mario-like pipes, these accept liquid and electricity.",
		"",
		"The Assembler is a crafting table with more steps, you place the required items in the grid (you may also insert  liquids) and after specificing the recipe it starts crafting.",
		"",
		"In the GUI, you will be able to intuite the grid and result of the machine, there is a liquid meter as well (for recipes that require Solvent or other), to the bottom of the machine you may select your recipe, to the right is the electricity, simple.",
		"(note: You do not require a Machine Template Folder to select a recipe anymore).",
		"",
		"You may craft this machine in your Steel Anvil, it's crafting cost is fair.",
		"",
		"This machine may be inserted with upgrades (ex: Speed Upgrade Mk.I)."
